[[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024765\">1016A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024759\">1008C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024947\">1008C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025054\">1060G80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025360\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025916\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024921\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024919\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024791\">1032B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024794\">1032B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025239\">3330D30</a></p><p>1. Unscrew retaining bolt (1a) and remove camshaft journal lubrication\npipe (1b).</p><p>2. Undo bolts (2a) and remove camshaft caps (2b).</p><p>3. Remove camshaft (3a) with oil seal (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002258.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the camshaft to the cylinder head.</p><p>Tighten the cap retaining bolts.</p><p>Fit the lubrication pipe and secure by\ntightening the retaining bolts.</p><p>Tighten the cap bolts to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CAMSHAFT CAPS</p></td><td><p>M7</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.